//RS 
//RS /// D-MEM-COPYSEM1=A: a read-only window has one owning materialization shape.
//RS /// Keep this mapping in sema so every consumer (inference, ownership, and
//RS /// diagnostics) agrees before TIR lowers the one shared copy node.
